{"id":"d088b00b91690ba0","group":"89","path":"89/89-df-numeral.md","title":"Numeral","display":"df-numeral — Numeral","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-df-numeral","aliases":["89-df-numeral"],"display":"df-numeral — Numeral","depends_on":["[[89-df-first-order-formula]]"],"created":"2026-10-09"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-df-numeral"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-df-numeral</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-numeral — Numeral"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ec3012ebbfa291bf\" href=\"?note=ec3012ebbfa291bf\" title=\"89-df-first-order-formula\">89-df-first-order-formula</a></span></div>"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-09"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L\">\\(\\mathcal L\\)</span> 是含常元 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\">\\(0\\)</span> 和一元函数符号 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 的一阶签名；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\omega\">\\(n\\in\\omega\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0,S\">\\(0,S\\)</span> 在右边是对象语言构造子，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n+1\">\\(n+1\\)</span> 是元语言后继；数词随签名实例化，不添加额外常元。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}numeral}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{num}_{\\mathcal L}&amp;:\\omega\\to\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\mathcal L),\\\\\n\\operatorname{num}_{\\mathcal L}(0)&amp;\\coloneqq0,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{num}_{\\mathcal L}(n+1)\\coloneqq S(\\operatorname{num}_{\\mathcal L}(n)),\\\\\n\\bar n&amp;\\coloneqq\\operatorname{num}_{\\mathcal L}(n),\\qquad\n\\mathrm{FV}(\\bar n)=\\varnothing.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}numeral}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{num}_{\\mathcal L}&amp;:\\omega\\to\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\mathcal L),\\\\\n\\operatorname{num}_{\\mathcal L}(0)&amp;\\coloneqq0,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{num}_{\\mathcal L}(n+1)\\coloneqq S(\\operatorname{num}_{\\mathcal L}(n)),\\\\\n\\bar n&amp;\\coloneqq\\operatorname{num}_{\\mathcal L}(n),\\qquad\n\\mathrm{FV}(\\bar n)=\\varnothing.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本条补齐本书实际使用但原压缩包未提供的基础接口；不恢复或冒充其他书籍的原文件。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-first-order-formula","status":"resolved","id":"ec3012ebbfa291bf","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-first-order-formula]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal L","display":false},{"tex":"0","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"0,S","display":false},{"tex":"n+1","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}numeral}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{num}_{\\mathcal L}&:\\omega\\to\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\mathcal L),\\\\\n\\operatorname{num}_{\\mathcal L}(0)&\\coloneqq0,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{num}_{\\mathcal L}(n+1)\\coloneqq S(\\operatorname{num}_{\\mathcal L}(n)),\\\\\n\\bar n&\\coloneqq\\operatorname{num}_{\\mathcal L}(n),\\qquad\n\\mathrm{FV}(\\bar n)=\\varnothing.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":999,"backlinks":[{"id":"646431d492b9ae8a","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"55612987d4585fa4","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"a257e5b1de6880b7"